TITLE: The new 'news-reader' tool
ACTION-NEEDED: false

;
We have added a new tool to Redrose, used to read latest Redrose news. 

On the next release, you will be able to use it. Also, we have to note that after all the alpha releases finish, we will become a curated rolling-release distribution updated every Friday.
This release will add networking and will update the kernel to 7.0.3. We did not make an update before because with no networking, the Copy Fail vulnerability is not a problem. However, after the new release we will take security very seriosuly, of course.
;
